  "patthana11.5:1.1": "dhammaṃ paṭicca-. ",
  "patthana11.5:2.1": "",
  "patthana11.5:3.1": "na kusalaṃ na avitakka vicāramattaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca-. na ",
